    <!--
        Onboarding copy (README §4.1–§4.5).

        Two rules run through all of it. It describes what the app does rather than what
        the user's body is doing — "the app filters", never "you have". And it never
        implies a limitation has been applied on the user's behalf: suggestions are
        phrased as questions to answer, because the user's confirmation is the only thing
        that reaches the filter (README §2).
    -->

