    <!--
        Movement limitation labels (README §4.5, §6).

        Phrased as the movement to avoid, in plain language, because the user reads these
        as a checklist of what currently applies to them and later as the reason an
        exercise was excluded. First consumed by the limitations screen in Phase 3.
    -->
